    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Graph BFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bidirectional search</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/word-ladder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 127</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Word Ladder</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Words are nodes, \"one letter apart\" is an edge, and the shortest ladder is a BFS. Never build the graph: generate neighbours by changing each letter to a..z and looking them up in a hash set, and run BFS from both ends, always growing the smaller frontier. O(N · L · 26) lookups, O(N · L) space.</p>\n"
  },
